Deriving five VRoid sample families, 2026-09-11.

Nothing below was chosen. Pans come from scripts/derive-pans.ts re-run against a
re-simulated body until a pass changed nothing; waivers are the numbers
rigProbe.test.ts itself reported, each rounded one step in the direction that
keeps the guard able to fail. The loop that did it is recorded at the end.

